contentText:
Ice Spice is opening up about battling depression, which she revealed led to her drastic weight loss in 2024. Shutting down more social media claims that she was taking Ozempic, the Bronx native clapped back at a detractor Wednesday (Feb. 25).

Ice&#8217;s response came to an X user clowning a clip of her workouts. &#8220;This weak a&#8211; video just shows it was definitely from Ozempic,&#8221; the fan wrote.

&#8220;Na it was depression im better now tho,&#8221; she replied.

